  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/750/103/jewelry_full_1000.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>💍 深入地下寻找珍贵宝石，并将它们制作成强大的首饰！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模组加载器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-Spell_Engine-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Spell Engine\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 探索更多 RPG 系列模组</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"圣骑士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"法师\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盗贼\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能树\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"军械库\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"武器库\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>📦 安装</h1>\n<h3>必需</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Power Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ranged-weapon-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ranged Weapon API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>单槽位模组</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fabric 端：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a>（二选一！）</li>\n<li>NeoForge 端：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>强烈推荐</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-roll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combat Roll</a> - 部分首饰可提供翻滚加成</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>💍 特性</h1>\n<p>收集总计 25 种以上全新的不同首饰！</p>\n<p>每件首饰都能提供不同的战斗相关加成。</p>\n<p>从前中期到后期材料，总有一款值得你获取。</p>\n<h2>深入地下开采珍贵宝石</h2>\n<p>宝石矿脉与钻石矿石位于相同深度，但生成概率仅为钻石的一半。</p>\n<p>挖掘时有机会随机掉落 6 种新宝石之一。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/425/gem_vein.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>将宝石合成为强力首饰</h2>\n<p>通过将宝石与金锭及下界合金锭组合来制作戒指和项链。</p>\n<p>首饰的属性加成可在 <code>config/jewelry/items.json</code> 中自定义配置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/424/crafting.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>扩展地牢战利品</h2>\n<p>在地牢宝箱中发现首饰。特殊地点（如末地城宝箱）会掉落极为特别、独一无二且无法合成的首饰。</p>\n<p>战利品表注入规则可在 <code>config/jewelry/loot.json</code> 中自定义配置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/426/dungeon.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>新增村庄结构</h2>\n<p>在村庄中寻找珠宝店，可与珠宝商村民交易首饰和材料。</p>\n<p>生成权重与数量限制可在 <code>config/jewelry/villages.json</code> 中自定义配置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/423/village.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>在后期战利品宝箱中寻找独特（稀有）首饰（例如：末地城宝藏、远古城市宝藏……）</p>\n<h1>专为多人游戏设计</h1>\n<p>打造你自己的 RPG 服务器。使用我们的优惠码可享受更低价格，同时也能为我们提供支持。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"获取服务器\"></a></p>\n<h1>🎁 想要更多内容？</h1>\n<p>发现由我们亲爱的合作伙伴制作的众多 Spell Engine 系列模组！</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"无政府\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"雇佣兵与工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手扩展（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂战士（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素法师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"力术师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"猎魔人（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡骑士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
